 happened one year  later in the year 852  during that time difference the port  they were constructing has been  completed  with parodies island now welcoming its  first foreign visitors  for a hundred years in the entire world  there is only one nation that doesn't  completely despise the aldean race  and that is the country of hizaru it's  essentially the equivalent to japan in  the world of attack on titan  as we know it's located in the east  thanks to gabi and the name hizaru  itself  is a phonetic reference to the word  sunrise with real life japan sometimes  being referred to as the land of the  rising sun  two years ago one of their ambassadors  went to visit parody's island  and it was none other than kyomi  azumabito she is the current head of the  azamobito clan  and we've already seen her a couple  times this season with her most notable  appearance being before the declaration  of war  she went backstage to wish willy type of  good luck but after which she left the  area completely  and didn't stick around for his  performance back then we had no idea why  kyomi left  but now it's clear she must have known  aaron was going to attack  given her relationship with parodies  island in the manga  mikasa had a shocked expression at  seeing kyomi for the first time  as her facial features reminded mikasa  of her mother  this scene was taken out of the anime  but it was our first indication that  these two were in some way related  we found out from this random kidnapper  in season 1 that mikasa and her mother  were the last descendants of an asian  clan  that lived on parodies island and that  clan had a special family crest which  had been passed down from generation to  generation  the first time we saw mikasa's mother in  the manga she had just finished branding  mikasa's arm with that symbol  but in that same scene in the anime she  was teaching mikasa how to stitch it  instead  during this flashback we get the reveal  from kiyomi that this is the symbol 