e did  all those terrible things because to  restore elder he needed to go along with  marley's plan  marley never knew that zeke had royal  blood so on the surface he pretended to  be a good soldier  who like everyone else was trying to get  the founding titan but  underneath he secretly planned to save  elder by helping to activate the  founding titan's true power  the reason he told kyo me the truth is  because he wanted his route to help with  his plan  and he offered her a financial incentive  to do this that's where the anime picks  up  as he reveals that on parodies island  there is a natural resource  known as the iceberg stone these stones  are converted into gas which powers  their equipment  but they're not the same as the glowing  stones which we saw in the rice chapel  the main point is that the ice burst  stone is a precious fuel source  that can only be found on paris island  and therefore it must be incredibly  valuable  the aliens on the island obviously have  no idea how much it's really worth  so if hizru agreed to help zeke with his  plan then he promised them access to  this resource  zeke offered them a deal they couldn't  refuse as he promised to not only  reunite them with their lost descendant  but more importantly  he promised them wealth that could  restore their nation to its former glory  before we move on it's worth mentioning  that this equipment that zeke gave to  kyomi  used to belong to zacharias when he was  alive zacharias was the second strongest  aldian soldier  only bettered by captain levi but in  season 2  the beast titan threw a freaking horse  at the guy before cornering him on the  ground  the beast titan had never seen odm gear  before so he stole it from zacharias and  now years later  he's using it as a diplomatic gift when  zeke initially uncovered it during this  episode  it was obvious that kyomi was already  aware of what it was despite this being  top secret information within mali  my assumption is that kyomi must have  had a spy working for her in mali  otherwise there's just no way she would  have known of the existence of this gear  anyhow getting back to zeke's plan his  idea to restore elder was to rebuild the  island and turn it into a modern nation  in exchange for parodies giving away  their natural resources the nation of  history would help to establish a modern  army with the latest weapons  and all the other stuff that you might  expect but zeke knows that mali isn't  just gonna leave parodies alone for all  that time  that's where the other part of the plan  comes in as to stop enemy nations from  attacking the island  he needs to meet aaron so they can  perform a partial rumbling with the  titans inside the walls  this partial rumbling will let everyone  know that parodies is not to be messed  with  which will give them sufficient time  hopefully to build up their population  and their army  which will allow them to defend  themselves without needing the rumbling  in the future  for the foreseeable future they will  need to maintain this threat until they  build up their army to a sufficient  standard  so that means that at some point before  their term ends both zeke and aaron will  need to find successes  as we all know to activate the power of  the founding titan you don't just need  the founding titan itself  but you also need a titan of royal blood  and by default that means the only  person who could succeed  zeke is historia historia needs to  inherit the beast item from zeke at some  point  and then spend her remaining years  having as many children as she can  that way the royal bloodline will never  die out and they will always have a  titan with royal blood  and the founding titan hanji questions  the ethics of this plan  because if they go ahead with it then  once historia gets the beast titan  she will have to be eaten within 13  years and then obviously her children  will be eaten by each other just  basically in an endless cycle so um it  is definitely not the most wholesome  plan  and you can see why hanji would have  some concerns about it that said  historia still agrees to inherit the  beast titan if necessary  much to eren's disapproval remember this  flashback happened two years ago  and at this time aaron refused to accept  zeke's plan  not least because he wanted to protect  historia from the fate that i just  described  as time progressed we can see that  present day erin now believes there is  no other way to protect the island  without the help of zeke  which is why he grew so impatient and  went to mali to pick up his brother  the reason aaron was so pissed off with  hanji in the scene i mean obviously  number one he didn't really want to talk  in the first place  but number two he didn't see any other  path for their survival than to go and  get zeke  yet she's acting like she can't  understand why he did it the anime did  this scene  so well and i say that because they  actually added in his titan lightning to  this moment  almost like he was so angry that he was  willing to transform as he stated  he can actually turn into the warmer  titan literally whenever he wants  as his power works even when the user is  trapped underground  as a result his decision to stay inside  this prison cell is a tactical choice  and the cell is not actually restraining  him anyhow  like hanji you might be wondering if  aaron no longer cares about historia  given that he has always been against  the idea of her becoming a titan  while we don't exactly know whether he  is or isn't against historia becoming  the beast titan now  what we do know is that at this moment  it can't happen because she is pregnant  during the episode we saw a conversation  between high-ranking members of the  military police  and they partly explained the situation  as i said these guys are military police  and it was their full intention that if  zeke came to the island  they would immediately turn estoria into  a pure titan  and have her eat the beast titan the  reason they wanted that to happen is  because they don't believe that zeke is  really on their side  and that whatever he's secretly planning  it can be stopped if historia inherits  his titan  according to this guy someone must have  told their plan to queen historia  to stop zeke from getting eaten straight  away his theory was that elena advised  historia to get pregnant  because a pregnancy would mean that she  wouldn't have to eat zeke until after  she gives birth  regardless of historia's motivations if  this theory is true  then her pregnancy has given zeke extra  time to do whatever he's planning to do  whilst this guy was getting drunk on  marley and wine nyle tried to be the  voice of reason  and argued that they can't turn history  into a titan now because it might be  fatal for the baby  although this is his first appearance of  the new season we've seen nile many  times before  as he is the commander of the military  police long-time friend of erwin  and also the guy who argued that aaron  should be executed  the anime then flashes back to one year  before the current events  which was when the scouts were helping  to build a railway system which was  actually foreshadowed in the last  episode  at that time parodies was waiting on  kyoumi to build relationships with other  nations across the world  on their behalf however hanji revealed  that the plan was a failure as the rest  of the world is actually somewhat united  by their hatred of parodies  aaron was concerned that this meant they  had no choice but to rely on zeke's plan  and therefore turn sauria into the beast  titan which as you can see makes him  visibly angry  hanji had one last ditch attempt to  avoid that outcome which is that the  survey core would meet people from other  countries face to face  instead of using kyomi as a middleman  hanji's proposal was that they create a  base in mali  presumably with the help of kyomi and  this would enable the survey corps 