o  whether aaron is working with them or  against them  but as usual this season his answer is  to talk things out with the man himself  as we saw in the last episode parodies  recently acquired the titan  transformation serum from mali  and if aaron is deemed untrustworthy  which he currently is  then this serum will be used to make  someone else eat aaron  and take away his titans that's why it's  crucial that armin and mikasa talk to  him so they can prove that aaron is on  their side  and save his life from those in the  military who might want to kill him  the episode ends with zeke politely  reading his book whilst the soldiers are  getting drunk  and you can just see from levi's  expression he is waiting for any excuse  to kill this man  with that said that was my breakdown for  episode 10 of attack on titan season 4.  for those who may have missed my  announcement earlier this week my new  discord server is now live  so you just need to hit the link in the  description if you want to join as usual  i'd appreciate if you dropped a like if  you liked this video  and let me know in the comments what you  thought about the episode until the next  one  peace

